WEBVTT

01:50.050 --> 01:53.950
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.310 --> 01:56.820
[Episode 21]

01:57.200 --> 01:58.680
I've finished editing
the promotional copy.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.759
I'll send it to you

01:59.759 --> 02:01.760
to see if anything needs to be modified.

02:01.760 --> 02:03.510
If you think everything looks good,

02:03.510 --> 02:05.070
we can find a peak traffic time

02:05.070 --> 02:06.350
and post it all at once tonight.

02:06.350 --> 02:07.070
Hey, Ms. Zhao,

02:07.070 --> 02:08.750
can you take a break for a while?

02:08.750 --> 02:11.150
I just had an iced Americano
on an empty stomach,

02:11.150 --> 02:12.750
and my stomach is killing me.

02:13.430 --> 02:14.120
Wait a second.

02:14.120 --> 02:15.520
This is right up my alley.

02:18.150 --> 02:20.120
Aren't you tired?

02:20.310 --> 02:21.430
Tired of what?

02:21.430 --> 02:23.030
I'm full of energy right now.

02:35.960 --> 02:37.890
Stomach-soothing special blend.

02:40.870 --> 02:41.840
Is this alcohol?

02:42.079 --> 02:43.079
It's for your stomach pain.

02:43.079 --> 02:43.910
No alcohol.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.470
Thanks.

02:47.000 --> 02:48.410
I was wondering,

02:48.840 --> 02:50.360
all this work you're doing—

02:50.360 --> 02:52.160
is it just to distract yourself?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.650
Distract myself from what?

02:54.960 --> 02:56.960
You're feeling emotionally empty,

02:57.000 --> 02:59.660
so you're finding other things
to fill the void.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.310
So in your eyes,

03:04.750 --> 03:05.630
I'm the kind of person

03:05.630 --> 03:07.470
who feels empty without a man and romance?

03:07.470 --> 03:09.310
No, that's not what I meant.

03:10.360 --> 03:11.470
Look, before,

03:11.470 --> 03:13.360
you were always very family-oriented.

03:13.360 --> 03:15.520
But now you've suddenly
become a workaholic.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.910
That's why I asked.

03:18.960 --> 03:19.800
Relax.

03:20.120 --> 03:21.030
I'm not upset.

03:22.120 --> 03:24.980
I don't think your impression
of me is wrong either.

03:25.079 --> 03:25.880
Tell you what,

03:26.520 --> 03:27.780
you can keep an eye on me

03:27.800 --> 03:29.280
and see how dedicated I can be,

03:29.280 --> 03:30.610
how long I can keep it up,

03:30.680 --> 03:33.079
and whether it's just a passing phase
to distract myself.

03:33.079 --> 03:33.810
Sounds good.

03:36.240 --> 03:36.960
By the way,

03:37.630 --> 03:39.320
in your eyes,

03:39.370 --> 03:40.700
what kind of person am I?

03:42.590 --> 03:43.650
A spoiled rich kid?

03:44.840 --> 03:45.710
A playboy?

03:47.360 --> 03:48.280
Or maybe

03:48.750 --> 03:49.630
a tech genius?

03:51.079 --> 03:51.880
None of those.

03:53.150 --> 03:54.430
None of them?

03:55.630 --> 03:56.590
Then what?

04:01.190 --> 04:02.470
You're just

04:03.000 --> 04:04.190
a

04:06.430 --> 04:07.080
virgin.

04:09.510 --> 04:09.910
Vir...

04:10.310 --> 04:11.750
Since I was young,

04:11.750 --> 04:12.870
from America to China,

04:12.870 --> 04:13.910
I've had...

04:14.270 --> 04:15.830
had countless girlfriends.

04:15.830 --> 04:17.829
If you don't believe me,
ask anyone in my circle.

04:17.829 --> 04:19.750
Every time I get a new car,

04:19.920 --> 04:21.310
I also get a new girlfriend.

04:21.310 --> 04:21.720
I...

04:22.360 --> 04:22.870
Perfect timing.

04:22.870 --> 04:24.670
If you don't believe me, ask him.

04:26.870 --> 04:27.480
Zhao,

04:27.480 --> 04:28.480
we came to help.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.760
What's going on?

04:30.870 --> 04:31.560
May I ask,

04:31.560 --> 04:34.420
how many times have you seen
Mr. Gong change his car?

04:38.950 --> 04:40.430
If not 10, at least 8 cars.

04:40.590 --> 04:41.150
See?

04:42.240 --> 04:43.310
How could I lie to you?

04:43.310 --> 04:44.630
You've misjudged me.

04:45.430 --> 04:47.390
Have you ever seen

04:47.390 --> 04:49.050
a woman in his passenger seat?

05:01.920 --> 05:02.690
Never.

05:04.070 --> 05:04.510
You...

05:04.830 --> 05:05.680
No, well,

05:05.830 --> 05:07.430
this is a misunderstanding.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.030
I...

05:08.510 --> 05:09.000
Well, I

05:09.000 --> 05:11.560
prefer not to bring female companions
to meet them,

05:11.560 --> 05:12.190
you know?

05:12.190 --> 05:12.680
One must

05:12.680 --> 05:14.140
maintain some mystery...

05:38.510 --> 05:39.570
Exactly. Mystery.

05:42.550 --> 05:43.950
Stop pretending with me.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.830
None of you understand.

05:58.830 --> 06:00.240
In our circle,

06:00.240 --> 06:00.920
we need

06:01.190 --> 06:02.800
to maintain a certain image.

06:03.440 --> 06:04.270
Don't act like that.

06:04.270 --> 06:05.530
You're not helping me.

06:05.690 --> 06:07.220
I'm just telling the truth.

06:07.940 --> 06:09.860
That's the image I have

06:09.910 --> 06:11.990
carefully crafted and maintained
for over 10 years.

06:11.990 --> 06:12.860
Over 10 years?

06:13.630 --> 06:15.190
You're quite dedicated.

06:15.750 --> 06:16.560
The club's

06:16.630 --> 06:18.890
most skilled veteran actor. That's you.

06:21.680 --> 06:22.390
Fine, fine.

06:22.680 --> 06:24.510
You're all ganging up on me,

06:24.510 --> 06:25.170
aren't you?

06:26.630 --> 06:27.560
-Yes.
-Yes.

06:28.470 --> 06:28.950
I...

06:29.610 --> 06:30.240
Cheers.

06:30.270 --> 06:30.790
Come on.

06:35.690 --> 06:36.550
Give me a break.

06:37.270 --> 06:37.930
Put it down.

06:39.830 --> 06:40.830
How are the project receivables

06:40.830 --> 06:43.030
I asked you to follow up on coming along?

06:44.240 --> 06:46.570
Some should come through early next week.

06:47.000 --> 06:47.750
However,

06:48.120 --> 06:50.180
it might not meet your requirements.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.520
I understand.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.960
Let's fill the gap first.

06:57.680 --> 06:58.630
What if...

06:58.800 --> 06:59.930
Let's do it this way.

07:00.630 --> 07:01.120
Go.

07:49.790 --> 07:51.190
Please take more photos for us.

07:51.190 --> 07:52.240
This is our coffee. Try it.

07:52.240 --> 07:53.190
Thanks for your support.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.000
Thank you.

07:55.070 --> 07:55.480
Here.

07:55.480 --> 07:56.600
This is our coffee.

07:56.870 --> 07:57.530
Give it a try.

07:57.530 --> 07:58.170
Try it.

07:58.720 --> 08:00.030
These photos look great.

08:00.030 --> 08:01.640
Come on, try our coffee.

08:01.830 --> 08:02.560
Remember to tag our location

08:02.560 --> 08:03.310
when you post them.

08:03.310 --> 08:04.970
You're really good-looking.

08:05.680 --> 08:07.000
You should have him take photos here

08:07.000 --> 08:08.630
with our logo.

08:08.630 --> 08:09.390
He looks even better.

08:09.390 --> 08:11.240
Remember to tag our location
after taking photos.

08:11.240 --> 08:11.560
No problem.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.160
Thank you.

08:14.080 --> 08:16.000
Our collaboration event
will last for one month.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.310
If you're interested,

08:17.310 --> 08:19.370
you can follow our official account.

08:19.720 --> 08:20.430
This is the updated...

08:20.430 --> 08:21.480
Excuse me, please make way.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.080
Excuse me.

08:22.680 --> 08:23.680
Each beverage...

08:23.680 --> 08:24.720
Coffee's here.

08:25.360 --> 08:26.040
Chief Feng,

08:26.270 --> 08:26.800
yours.

08:26.800 --> 08:27.400
Thank you.

08:27.600 --> 08:28.530
You're welcome.

08:29.040 --> 08:29.750
Thanks.

08:29.950 --> 08:30.880
You're welcome.

08:32.000 --> 08:32.720
Thank you.

08:33.000 --> 08:34.059
Perfect Partners.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.030
What would you like to drink?

08:35.030 --> 08:36.750
I'd like a hot Rongcheng Snowy Night.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.240
Okay.

08:37.240 --> 08:38.840
A hot Rongcheng Snowy Night.

08:39.870 --> 08:40.549
What about you?

08:40.549 --> 08:40.960
Perfect Partners.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.320
The shop is really busy.

08:42.630 --> 08:44.290
Do you still have time to come?

08:46.480 --> 08:47.630
I have a last-minute meeting.

08:47.630 --> 08:49.030
I probably won't make it.

08:49.910 --> 08:50.550
You can each take

08:50.550 --> 08:52.000
a postcard.

08:52.150 --> 08:52.950
Just a moment.

08:53.030 --> 08:53.510
Okay.

08:54.840 --> 08:55.550
Take it easy. Have you burnt yourself?

08:55.550 --> 08:56.630
It's fine. It's fine.

08:56.630 --> 08:58.830
Hello, who ordered the flower baskets?

09:02.270 --> 09:03.440
Who sent these?

09:04.830 --> 09:06.270
[Wish Regard & ME event a great success]
[Pei Zhen]

09:08.960 --> 09:10.200
Just put them outside for me.

09:10.200 --> 09:10.510
Okay.

09:10.510 --> 09:11.510
Behind that standee.

09:11.510 --> 09:11.790
Got it.

09:11.790 --> 09:12.390
Thank you.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.630
Mr. Pei.

09:20.340 --> 09:21.840
I saw Ms. Zhao's post on social media.

09:21.840 --> 09:22.960
I happen to be free today,

09:22.960 --> 09:24.290
so I came to join the fun.

09:24.320 --> 09:25.740
The flowers you sent are beautiful.

09:25.740 --> 09:27.270
Thank you on behalf of Zhao.

09:28.390 --> 09:29.220
You...

09:30.440 --> 09:31.750
I spilled coffee just now.

09:31.750 --> 09:33.080
I'll take you to see her.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.000
Mr. Pei is here.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.330
He brought you flowers.

09:35.830 --> 09:36.710
Mr. Pei,

09:36.870 --> 09:37.790
your presence is more than enough.

09:37.790 --> 09:39.670
There was no need to bring anything.

09:39.670 --> 09:40.510
For an event like this,

09:40.510 --> 09:41.550
you need some ceremony.

09:41.550 --> 09:42.610
Thank you, really.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.300
Excuse me, I'd like to order.

09:44.300 --> 09:44.820
Okay.

09:44.840 --> 09:45.990
Mr. Pei, I need to attend to something.

09:45.990 --> 09:47.990
Hu Xiu, please look after him for me.

09:47.990 --> 09:48.930
No problem. Go ahead.

09:48.930 --> 09:49.450
Okay.

09:52.320 --> 09:52.670
This

09:52.670 --> 09:53.120
is the themed board game

09:53.120 --> 09:53.870
specially designed

09:53.870 --> 09:56.070
by Regard for the collaboration event.

09:57.510 --> 09:58.750
So is this board game design

09:58.750 --> 10:00.000
related to the murder mystery game?

10:00.000 --> 10:00.670
Of course it is.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.080
It's derived from the murder mystery game.

10:02.080 --> 10:03.120
Look at these 4 main characters.

10:03.120 --> 10:05.250
They're from the murder mystery game.

10:09.270 --> 10:10.400
Why is Pei Zhen here?

10:10.560 --> 10:11.440
I don't have enough time
to clean all this up.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.440
Can you check if the hygiene is okay?

10:14.910 --> 10:16.510
For example, if there are 6 people today,

10:16.510 --> 10:18.440
whoever loses has to drink coffee?

10:33.620 --> 10:35.480
Your stepbrother
is also here for the event.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.170
Mr. Xiao.

10:44.550 --> 10:44.910
It's your first time

10:44.910 --> 10:45.670
in Dynamism.

10:45.670 --> 10:46.670
How do you like it?

10:56.480 --> 10:56.910
Never mind.

10:56.910 --> 10:58.110
I'm gonna do it later.

11:01.910 --> 11:02.550
Mr. Pei.

11:03.120 --> 11:04.360
Do you need the restroom?

11:04.360 --> 11:05.630
The men's room is inside.

11:05.630 --> 11:06.630
I came to find you.

11:09.150 --> 11:10.360
What's this?

11:11.320 --> 11:12.200
A silk scarf.

11:12.670 --> 11:13.440
Put it on.

11:13.670 --> 11:14.930
Isn't this spot dirty?

11:17.200 --> 11:18.730
Where did you get this from?

11:19.070 --> 11:20.810
I had it delivered from the mall.

11:20.810 --> 11:21.610
Just arrived.

11:39.510 --> 11:41.240
Gaining followers so quickly.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.620
Look how happy you are.

11:46.360 --> 11:47.200
So, Ms. Zhao,

11:47.200 --> 11:49.000
should you buy me a cup of coffee?

11:50.390 --> 11:51.080
Gong Huaicong,

11:51.080 --> 11:52.210
thank you for today.

11:54.270 --> 11:56.670
Your promotion today is really effective.

11:57.170 --> 11:59.770
Just one day
and I've gained so many followers.

12:00.080 --> 12:00.960
At this rate,

12:00.960 --> 12:03.690
I should reach about 50,000 followers
in a month.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.720
You know,

12:12.270 --> 12:14.200
you seem pretty careless usually,

12:14.750 --> 12:16.280
but when working together,

12:16.320 --> 12:17.480
you're quite responsible

12:17.480 --> 12:19.080
and make people feel at ease.

12:22.820 --> 12:23.550
Well...

12:24.000 --> 12:25.080
Well...

12:25.080 --> 12:26.480
That's an exaggeration.

12:27.790 --> 12:28.840
I'm serious.

12:29.960 --> 12:30.960
This event

12:30.960 --> 12:32.420
is a success thanks to you.

12:33.190 --> 12:34.390
Actually,

12:34.510 --> 12:36.440
you have quite a talent for management,

12:36.440 --> 12:37.600
and on top of that,

12:37.870 --> 12:39.600
you know some technical stuff.

12:40.080 --> 12:41.390
I believe your club

12:41.390 --> 12:43.590
will definitely get better and better.

12:51.390 --> 12:52.670
Well, I've been busy here all day,

12:52.670 --> 12:54.670
and I should get back
to check on the club.

12:54.670 --> 12:55.670
I'll head out now.

12:56.960 --> 12:57.510
Take care.

12:57.510 --> 12:58.120
It's fine.

13:03.410 --> 13:05.170
Why is he being so shy now?

13:39.240 --> 13:39.910
Walking without watching
where you're going.

13:39.910 --> 13:41.170
Are you sleepwalking?

13:41.790 --> 13:43.550
I was taking a photo of the moon for you.

13:43.550 --> 13:44.390
I was about to send it to you

13:44.390 --> 13:45.450
when you showed up.

13:47.150 --> 13:49.550
You still need to watch
where you're going.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.550
Why are you angry?

13:52.240 --> 13:53.570
Did Pei Zhen come today?

13:54.630 --> 13:55.630
How did you know?

13:56.340 --> 13:57.670
That's what he gave you?

14:01.320 --> 14:02.320
You don't like it?

14:04.890 --> 14:05.620
It's too ugly

14:05.840 --> 14:07.370
and doesn't suit you at all.

14:08.330 --> 14:09.790
No, I think it looks nice.

14:09.790 --> 14:11.150
I really like it.

14:14.410 --> 14:15.010
Come here.

14:22.030 --> 14:23.230
Stop messing around.

14:27.580 --> 14:29.200
This isn't from Pei Zhen.

14:33.430 --> 14:35.320
It's a custom napkin from Zhao's shop.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.960
If someone thinks it's too ugly

14:36.960 --> 14:37.550
and unsuitable,

14:37.550 --> 14:38.680
then I won't wear it.

14:40.030 --> 14:41.890
You're deliberately teasing me.

14:44.510 --> 14:45.080
Are you playing with me?

14:45.080 --> 14:46.150
I'm not.

14:46.150 --> 14:46.910
Are you playing with me?

14:46.910 --> 14:47.360
I'm not.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.320
Are you playing with me?

14:48.320 --> 14:48.720
No.

14:48.720 --> 14:49.200
Are you?

14:49.200 --> 14:50.120
I'm losing my balance.

14:50.120 --> 14:51.450
Are you playing with me?

14:51.840 --> 14:52.720
Will you dare to do it again?

14:52.720 --> 14:53.390
I won't dare.

14:53.390 --> 14:54.000
I won't.

14:54.830 --> 14:55.400
Look.

14:56.200 --> 14:57.320
Don't we look just like

14:57.320 --> 14:59.030
a compass at this moment?

14:59.030 --> 14:59.670
Compass?

15:02.070 --> 15:03.530
Then try drawing a circle.

15:03.600 --> 15:04.400
Draw a circle?

15:05.030 --> 15:05.720
Don't move.

15:06.390 --> 15:07.550
Stay still.

15:07.550 --> 15:08.280
I won't move.

15:08.570 --> 15:10.370
It doesn't really look like one.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.150
Come.

15:12.670 --> 15:13.080
Yes?

15:13.080 --> 15:13.680
Come here.

15:14.570 --> 15:17.860
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

15:14.960 --> 15:16.020
What are you doing?

15:17.240 --> 15:18.240
Drawing a circle.

15:18.910 --> 15:24.200
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

15:24.860 --> 15:30.360
♪ Held hands and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

15:31.320 --> 15:34.690
♪ I won't wander anymore ♪

15:46.510 --> 15:47.510
Stop right there.

15:51.600 --> 15:53.730
I heard you took the company accounts.

15:54.920 --> 15:56.250
What are you going to do?

15:58.960 --> 16:01.090
As the general manager of the company,

16:01.270 --> 16:03.400
don't I have the right to review these?

17:05.790 --> 17:06.400
Mr. Pei,

17:06.920 --> 17:07.790
thank you for your kindness,

17:07.790 --> 17:09.160
but I can't accept this.

17:10.680 --> 17:11.880
It's just a scarf.

17:12.240 --> 17:14.109
My 300-yuan shirt

17:14.200 --> 17:16.660
really doesn't match
such a high-end scarf.

17:17.069 --> 17:17.680
Mr. Pei,

17:17.890 --> 17:19.550
some things are too valuable.

17:19.950 --> 17:22.020
I can't appreciate fine things.

17:22.200 --> 17:24.060
It would be a waste to give it to me.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.170
Are you full?

18:01.480 --> 18:03.280
Thank you for the meal, Mr. Xiao.

18:03.470 --> 18:04.600
Glad you enjoyed it.

18:05.680 --> 18:06.720
Then I'll wash the dishes.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.180
No need.

18:07.190 --> 18:07.990
I'll clean up.

18:08.970 --> 18:09.900
How thoughtful.

18:10.540 --> 18:11.970
After all, I stood you up earlier today.

18:11.970 --> 18:13.370
I should make it up to you.

18:14.590 --> 18:15.400
Well...

18:16.070 --> 18:18.000
Can I look around your living room?

18:18.070 --> 18:19.590
I was too nervous last time I was here.

18:19.590 --> 18:21.200
I didn't get a chance
to look around properly.

18:21.200 --> 18:21.730
Go ahead.

18:21.850 --> 18:23.250
I'll join you in a minute.

19:13.720 --> 19:14.980
Can you play the piano?

19:18.270 --> 19:18.880
No.

19:21.200 --> 19:23.260
My dad gave this to me when I was young.

19:23.750 --> 19:24.680
Unfortunately,

19:25.030 --> 19:25.960
I was naughty

19:26.110 --> 19:28.170
and slacked off when learning piano.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.000
Later...

19:39.830 --> 19:41.790
This piano is well-maintained.

19:42.250 --> 19:43.780
It's even tuned regularly.

19:45.590 --> 19:47.850
I asked my uncle in China
to keep it for me,

19:48.390 --> 19:51.050
and I moved it here
after returning to Shanghai.

19:53.640 --> 19:54.400
So...

19:56.070 --> 19:57.400
Would you like to learn?

19:59.270 --> 20:00.000
You know how?

20:00.910 --> 20:02.350
I know a little bit.

20:41.350 --> 20:42.550
Would you like to try?

21:16.110 --> 21:16.910
In the future,

21:17.240 --> 21:19.570
I'll teach you
how to play the piano, okay?

21:22.640 --> 21:23.920
Then I'm counting on you,

21:23.920 --> 21:24.550
Ms. Hu.

22:12.500 --> 22:12.950
Come.

22:20.570 --> 22:22.830
Is everything okay between you and Zhen?

22:22.830 --> 22:23.640
I've noticed these days,

22:23.640 --> 22:25.370
he doesn't eat with us anymore.

22:26.100 --> 22:28.060
Don't be too hard on him sometimes.

22:28.830 --> 22:31.210
What problems could there be
between father and son?

22:31.210 --> 22:31.820
Then,

22:31.850 --> 22:33.970
could there be some issue at work?

22:34.140 --> 22:34.620
No.

22:35.510 --> 22:36.270
No?

22:37.670 --> 22:39.630
Could it be because of that girl?

22:41.350 --> 22:42.270
What girl?

22:43.140 --> 22:44.380
Nothing. Let's eat.

22:59.100 --> 23:01.760
Looks like
we don't have to work overtime today.

23:03.200 --> 23:05.350
Last time was just an accident.

23:05.420 --> 23:07.950
What kind of job requires overtime
every day?

23:11.920 --> 23:13.110
However...

23:15.180 --> 23:18.180
Don't you think Lyman's feedback process
this time

23:18.210 --> 23:19.610
is ridiculously slow?

23:20.100 --> 23:21.520
Our studio is already done,

23:21.520 --> 23:23.320
but Forma still needs more time.

23:24.490 --> 23:26.580
Forma is a big company after all.

23:26.790 --> 23:29.000
The process may be more complicated.

23:31.510 --> 23:32.310
That's true.

24:00.160 --> 24:00.640
Okay.

24:01.790 --> 24:02.590
See you later.

24:02.960 --> 24:05.220
I'll send you the location on your phone.

24:14.590 --> 24:15.550
Mr. Xiao.

24:16.780 --> 24:17.710
Why are you here?

24:19.350 --> 24:21.480
Mr. Pei left his lunch box here before.

24:23.790 --> 24:25.680
I was wondering if you could

24:25.830 --> 24:26.760
return it for me.

24:28.710 --> 24:31.510
Mr. Pei probably doesn't need
this lunch box back.

24:33.590 --> 24:34.200
Yes,

24:35.310 --> 24:36.200
but no matter what,

24:36.200 --> 24:37.960
I think it should be returned.

24:41.270 --> 24:43.200
If it's inconvenient for you,

24:43.630 --> 24:45.590
then I'll just...

24:48.790 --> 24:51.120
Call a FlashEx service
to send it to Forma.

24:56.550 --> 24:57.160
Fine.

24:57.530 --> 24:58.240
Give it to me.

24:58.240 --> 24:59.370
I'll take care of it.

25:00.380 --> 25:02.240
Zhao asked me
to go to her shop after work.

25:02.240 --> 25:03.100
What about you?

25:03.980 --> 25:04.760
I have an appointment,

25:04.760 --> 25:05.820
so I won't be going.

25:14.330 --> 25:15.090
I'm leaving.

25:21.060 --> 25:21.990
Running so fast.

25:48.680 --> 25:49.400
Zhiyu.

25:49.920 --> 25:50.480
Uncle Xu.

25:51.410 --> 25:52.080
Look.

25:55.160 --> 25:56.110
Huang Yide.

25:56.510 --> 25:58.310
The owner of Xinde Building Materials.

25:58.310 --> 26:00.640
He's in the cement and concrete business.

26:00.920 --> 26:02.400
He is the owner of that company

26:02.400 --> 26:03.730
Pei Kanghua is desperate to terminate

26:03.730 --> 26:04.720
the contract with.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.920
Judging by his build,

26:06.510 --> 26:08.550
he looks a bit like that person
from back then.

26:08.550 --> 26:10.110
This person's age

26:10.510 --> 26:12.440
is about the same as Pei Kanghua's.

26:13.070 --> 26:14.930
He speaks with a Nancheng accent.

26:14.990 --> 26:16.030
Nancheng accent?

26:19.310 --> 26:20.200
Rest assured.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.550
I promise,

26:21.950 --> 26:23.610
everything we just discussed

26:23.910 --> 26:25.700
will die with me.

26:25.720 --> 26:27.180
Good that you understand.

26:27.310 --> 26:28.200
Then I...

26:28.910 --> 26:31.060
The accent and build both match up.

26:32.030 --> 26:33.830
He must be the one from back then.

26:34.230 --> 26:35.440
This Mr. Huang

26:35.470 --> 26:37.670
is in the cement and concrete business.

26:39.070 --> 26:41.640
His factory has been poorly managed
these years.

26:41.640 --> 26:43.160
The fact that it's still running

26:43.160 --> 26:45.420
must be thanks to Pei Kanghua's support.

26:45.590 --> 26:46.920
Logically speaking,

26:47.160 --> 26:49.420
Pei Kanghua terminating their contract

26:50.580 --> 26:51.910
shouldn't be good news.

26:52.660 --> 26:54.050
But this Mr. Huang

26:54.310 --> 26:55.590
seems quite spirited.

26:56.100 --> 26:57.160
I checked and found

26:57.470 --> 26:59.420
that during the period
when the contract was terminated,

26:59.420 --> 27:00.870
he just took an order

27:00.900 --> 27:03.630
to supply materials
for a reservoir dam project.

27:03.860 --> 27:05.050
A reservoir dam?

27:06.140 --> 27:07.490
That's a huge contract.

27:08.400 --> 27:10.330
His factory can't handle it at all.

27:11.130 --> 27:12.990
He's added a lot of new equipment.

27:13.020 --> 27:14.750
Must be expanding production.

27:15.350 --> 27:17.540
Talk about biting off
more than you can chew.

27:17.540 --> 27:18.060
Zhiyu,

27:18.550 --> 27:19.790
what's our next move?

27:26.290 --> 27:27.550
I want to take a gamble.

27:36.680 --> 27:37.440
Zhao.

27:37.470 --> 27:40.400
You've been checking these accounts
for an hour now.

27:41.350 --> 27:42.200
Can't help it.

27:42.590 --> 27:44.520
Business has been too good lately.

27:45.790 --> 27:46.830
Someone

27:46.830 --> 27:48.680
is just obsessed with money.

27:50.290 --> 27:51.130
Gong Huaicong,

27:51.130 --> 27:52.320
if you're tired,

27:52.680 --> 27:53.550
just go home

27:53.550 --> 27:54.640
and get some sleep.

27:57.100 --> 27:59.050
Sleeping is so boring.

28:03.640 --> 28:06.310
We've been working so hard for so long.

28:06.830 --> 28:07.790
Don't you think

28:07.880 --> 28:09.680
we deserve to reward ourselves?

28:10.960 --> 28:12.420
What are you planning now?

28:13.480 --> 28:14.850
I was thinking

28:15.510 --> 28:16.750
we should go out this weekend.

28:16.750 --> 28:18.350
Find a place with nice scenery

28:18.350 --> 28:19.480
and have a good rest.

28:21.590 --> 28:22.240
My treat.

28:26.790 --> 28:27.720
Think about it.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.680
When was the last time you had

28:31.160 --> 28:32.220
a really good time?

28:35.940 --> 28:36.490
No way.

28:40.880 --> 28:41.990
I'll invite Hu Xiu.

28:45.070 --> 28:45.960
No problem.

28:46.710 --> 28:47.410
How about this?

28:47.410 --> 28:49.010
Ask Hu Xiu to invite Xiao too.

28:49.960 --> 28:50.490
Alright.

28:52.400 --> 28:53.000
Time to go.

28:54.200 --> 28:54.840
Let's go.

29:04.830 --> 29:05.560
Are you home?

29:06.830 --> 29:07.480
Yes, I am.

29:21.970 --> 29:23.100
Get some rest early.

29:26.960 --> 29:27.600
By the way,

29:27.930 --> 29:29.390
are you free this weekend?

29:31.110 --> 29:31.720
Yes, I am.

29:31.960 --> 29:32.560
What's up?

29:37.030 --> 29:38.760
I want to go to Zhejiang for fun.

29:43.600 --> 29:44.930
For 2 days and one night.

29:54.550 --> 29:55.680
Don't you want to go?

29:57.020 --> 29:57.590
Okay.

30:00.830 --> 30:01.680
Okay.

30:03.530 --> 30:04.850
He said okay.

30:07.070 --> 30:07.730
Good night.

30:21.880 --> 30:22.680
Xiao Zhiyu.

30:32.650 --> 30:33.180
Let's go.

30:33.980 --> 30:34.700
And...

30:46.190 --> 30:47.320
Why are you here?

31:01.270 --> 31:01.840
Hu Xiu.

31:02.510 --> 31:03.510
You didn't tell Xiao

31:03.510 --> 31:05.910
that the four of us
were going out together?

31:06.350 --> 31:07.880
I guess I didn't mention it.

31:09.720 --> 31:10.590
I have to call you out on this.

31:10.590 --> 31:12.050
Who do you have to call out?

31:16.680 --> 31:17.270
Me.

31:17.550 --> 31:18.360
Look at me.

31:18.750 --> 31:19.240
It's all my fault.

31:19.240 --> 31:20.030
I'm to blame.

31:20.030 --> 31:21.270
I didn't tell you.

31:22.560 --> 31:23.990
Now I understand

31:24.200 --> 31:26.840
why you've been managing
the club all this time.

31:26.840 --> 31:27.360
Why?

31:27.900 --> 31:29.230
You're quick to grovel.

31:29.280 --> 31:31.210
Perfect for the service industry.

31:35.090 --> 31:35.650
Hey,

31:35.680 --> 31:37.680
do you really need that much sunscreen?

31:37.680 --> 31:40.000
Even the sun outside
isn't as harsh as your words.

31:40.000 --> 31:40.720
Sunscreen is something

31:40.720 --> 31:42.290
you need to apply all year round.

31:42.290 --> 31:43.920
If you don't understand, just keep quiet.

31:43.920 --> 31:44.920
How could I not understand?

31:44.920 --> 31:46.000
Of course, I understand.

31:46.000 --> 31:47.350
UV rays are present all year round,

31:47.350 --> 31:47.880
right?

31:48.030 --> 31:49.630
I even know about that thing,

31:49.640 --> 31:51.640
the SPF, sun protection factor.

31:52.250 --> 31:52.680
Yes, yes, yes.

31:52.680 --> 31:53.270
You know best.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.000
You know everything.

31:54.000 --> 31:54.960
Mr. Know-it-all.

31:54.960 --> 31:55.550
No,

31:55.720 --> 31:56.830
I just didn't expect

31:56.830 --> 31:58.680
that you would be so...

32:07.640 --> 32:08.840
I can't bear to watch.

32:24.960 --> 32:25.350
Hello,

32:25.350 --> 32:26.750
are you checking in?

32:26.750 --> 32:27.160
Yes.

32:27.350 --> 32:29.030
What room types do you have available now?

32:29.030 --> 32:30.160
I'd like spacious rooms

32:30.160 --> 32:31.090
with a nice view.

32:31.120 --> 32:31.680
Certainly.

32:31.680 --> 32:32.920
How many nights will you be staying?

32:32.920 --> 32:33.550
Just one night.

32:33.550 --> 32:34.000
Okay.

32:34.270 --> 32:35.000
We currently have

32:35.000 --> 32:37.310
suites and rooms with views available.

32:37.310 --> 32:38.770
How many rooms do you need?

32:40.640 --> 32:42.380
How would you like to arrange your room
as a couple?

32:42.380 --> 32:44.440
How about I get you one room together?

32:46.970 --> 32:48.760
Xiu and I will be fine with one suite.

32:48.760 --> 32:49.320
Okay.

32:50.840 --> 32:53.040
Then let's book 2 more rooms with a view.

32:53.230 --> 32:54.090
Very well, Sir.

32:54.900 --> 32:55.450
Here.

32:56.030 --> 32:58.030
The hotel's scenic park
and recreational facilities

32:58.030 --> 32:59.660
are complimentary for all our guests.

32:59.660 --> 33:00.760
Have a pleasant stay.

33:00.760 --> 33:01.710
Great, thank you.

33:01.710 --> 33:02.200
Here.

33:03.590 --> 33:04.920
Let's go out and have a look around later.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.350
Sure. We'll drop off our luggage first

33:05.040 --> 33:10.910
♪ Life lays out the outline of my scenes ♪

33:06.350 --> 33:07.680
and then meet downstairs.

33:07.680 --> 33:08.160
Okay.

33:08.960 --> 33:09.500
See you soon.

33:09.500 --> 33:09.910
Okay.

33:12.140 --> 33:15.620
♪ The last act
was a monologue in a dream ♪

33:16.820 --> 33:20.590
♪ And in the next,
I wander through the city's noise ♪

33:21.270 --> 33:23.440
This Ferris wheel should give us
a view of the entire lake.

33:21.750 --> 33:24.810
♪ So many arrivals
that turned out to be nothing ♪

33:23.550 --> 33:24.920
Want to go up and take a look?

33:24.920 --> 33:25.310
Sure.

33:25.310 --> 33:25.840
Let's go.

33:26.240 --> 33:30.310
♪ I'm counting the beats of the clock ♪

33:30.510 --> 33:30.920
Let's go, come on.

33:30.870 --> 33:34.810
♪ I can't tell which platform
is for leaving or returning ♪

33:30.920 --> 33:32.650
The view must be great up there.

33:33.000 --> 33:34.530
Let's take a ride together.

33:35.030 --> 33:36.240
There are still seats available.

33:35.480 --> 33:39.760
♪ Until you walk toward me ♪

33:37.480 --> 33:38.240
Now is the time

33:38.240 --> 33:39.550
for them to stay alone.

33:39.550 --> 33:40.280
Understand?

33:41.320 --> 33:44.900
♪ And my breath softens ♪

33:46.670 --> 33:51.050
♪ I forget every absurd line ♪

33:48.480 --> 33:49.240
Look.

33:49.440 --> 33:50.970
We can already see the lake.

33:51.820 --> 33:55.190
♪ Because of you ♪

33:52.440 --> 33:53.370
It's beautiful.

33:54.680 --> 33:56.160
Look at those mountains covered in mist

33:55.970 --> 34:02.200
♪ All those postures, it turns out
you were not part of my story ♪

33:56.160 --> 33:57.620
and surrounded by clouds.

33:58.200 --> 33:59.650
You're blocking my view.

34:04.750 --> 34:05.640
Let go.

34:05.640 --> 34:07.000
I'll stay still.

34:07.500 --> 34:11.800
♪ This question is so simple and plain,
but hard for me to explain ♪

34:12.889 --> 34:17.360
♪ Why is this feeling so
foreign yet reliable? ♪

34:14.400 --> 34:15.130
What's this?

34:15.280 --> 34:16.030
It's for you.

34:17.750 --> 34:19.690
♪ We brushed past each other
under the trees in my dream ♪

34:19.230 --> 34:20.360
When did you...

34:19.719 --> 34:21.580
♪ After waking, petals cover the balcony ♪

34:21.030 --> 34:22.590
I prepared it before coming here,

34:21.659 --> 34:26.590
♪ If love's an agreed accident, I imagine
you in every alternate universe ♪

34:23.070 --> 34:25.280
but never found the right moment
to give it to you.

34:25.280 --> 34:26.080
Do you like it?

34:26.840 --> 34:29.590
♪ Whoosh, in the cycle of memories ♪

34:29.920 --> 34:33.639
♪ I lost the voice of reason ♪

34:32.800 --> 34:33.440
It's nice.

34:36.230 --> 34:42.370
♪ Lay bare all the flaws,
then gentle grace befalls ♪

34:37.070 --> 34:37.590
Look.

34:43.560 --> 34:48.239
♪ I travel through the four seasons
and sea of people ♪

34:48.909 --> 34:53.870
♪ And fall into
this anticipation called "you" ♪

34:54.389 --> 34:57.750
♪ Because of you ♪

34:58.910 --> 35:05.340
♪ So you're beside the story
written by fate ♪

35:05.530 --> 35:06.950
♪ Oh, okay ♪

35:07.550 --> 35:09.550
♪ Oh, okay ♪

35:10.460 --> 35:12.460
♪ Oh, okay ♪

35:12.830 --> 35:14.560
♪ Oh, okay ♪

35:15.100 --> 35:16.840
♪ Oh, okay ♪

35:17.250 --> 35:20.360
♪ Oh, okay, my love ♪

35:19.760 --> 35:20.820
Give me some water.

35:21.190 --> 35:22.070
I bought grapefruit flavor.

35:21.620 --> 35:25.480
♪ It turns out you're my exception ♪

35:22.800 --> 35:24.330
This is my favorite flavor.

35:24.400 --> 35:24.960
You're sweating.

35:24.960 --> 35:26.760
Drink this to hydrate yourself.

35:36.150 --> 35:36.670
Atmosphere.

35:36.670 --> 35:37.400
Atmosphere.

36:03.950 --> 36:05.550
Where do you want to go later?

36:25.580 --> 36:29.590
♪ Under streetlights, I grow tired again ♪

36:30.540 --> 36:33.150
♪ Where did she go tonight? ♪

36:33.820 --> 36:36.170
♪ I don't really know why ♪

36:37.790 --> 36:40.150
♪ At the edge of the road ♪

36:40.220 --> 36:43.240
♪ In the crowd, in the night ♪

36:42.110 --> 36:42.840
Don't move.

36:45.110 --> 36:51.410
♪ Who hasn't paid the price
and still fell down ♪

36:52.260 --> 36:56.020
♪ Stay with me tonight,
look at the starlights ♪

36:57.900 --> 37:03.570
♪ Even when life feels absurd
like a stage ♪

37:04.630 --> 37:09.810
♪ Every step feels so hard ♪

37:11.610 --> 37:15.330
♪ But in this world
there's always someone ♪

37:12.220 --> 37:13.480
Stop here for a moment.

37:15.620 --> 37:20.450
♪ Who starts again like I do now? ♪

37:29.630 --> 37:31.230
There are so many coins here.

37:31.230 --> 37:33.030
Wishes made here must come true.

37:39.320 --> 37:40.960
Only one left.

37:41.110 --> 37:43.720
Remember what you said
during Spring Festival?

37:43.720 --> 37:46.040
About having a wish you wanted to fulfill?

37:46.040 --> 37:49.790
♪ Stay with me tonight,
look at the starlights ♪

37:51.000 --> 37:56.670
♪ Even when life feels absurd
like a stage ♪

37:58.020 --> 38:03.200
♪ Every step feels so hard ♪

38:04.610 --> 38:08.340
♪ But in this world
there's always someone ♪

38:08.800 --> 38:13.630
♪ Who starts again just like I am ♪

38:21.000 --> 38:21.640
Xiao.

38:21.670 --> 38:23.710
I don't mean to interrupt
your private time.

38:23.710 --> 38:25.900
Felix will be video conferencing
with me soon.

38:25.900 --> 38:27.070
We need to discuss
the new instance dungeon's

38:27.070 --> 38:28.280
virtual reality effects.

38:28.280 --> 38:29.760
I'm having trouble deciding.

38:29.760 --> 38:31.120
I need your judgment on this.

38:31.120 --> 38:31.560
Okay.

38:32.110 --> 38:33.570
I'll head back right away.

38:34.190 --> 38:35.150
Work stuff?

38:35.770 --> 38:36.640
Club business.

38:37.590 --> 38:38.190
Let's go.

38:57.630 --> 38:59.160
You go ahead with your work.

38:59.280 --> 38:59.670
Okay.

38:59.840 --> 39:01.670
I'll come find you as soon as I'm done.

39:01.670 --> 39:02.480
No rush.

39:02.500 --> 39:04.440
I'll just walk around near the hotel.

39:04.440 --> 39:06.100
I haven't been to many places.

39:06.230 --> 39:07.360
Are you going alone?

39:07.800 --> 39:08.800
I'll go with Zhao.

39:09.190 --> 39:09.920
Don't worry.

39:10.550 --> 39:11.080
Alright.

39:29.740 --> 39:30.670
Alright, Felix.

39:30.710 --> 39:33.040
Let's proceed as Mr. Xiao just suggested.

39:33.550 --> 39:34.880
I look forward to your landing.

39:34.880 --> 39:35.760
No problem.

39:35.940 --> 39:36.650
-Bye.
-Bye.

39:47.710 --> 39:49.360
Shall we go eat together later?

39:49.360 --> 39:49.880
Yes.

39:49.880 --> 39:51.810
I booked a restaurant downstairs.

39:52.070 --> 39:53.550
It's perfect timing to go now.

39:53.550 --> 39:54.410
Where is Hu Xiu?

39:55.290 --> 39:56.370
I didn't see her.

39:56.550 --> 39:58.230
I thought she was with you.

39:59.560 --> 40:00.400
You guys go to the restaurant first.

40:00.400 --> 40:01.930
I'll go out and look for her.

40:04.580 --> 40:06.760
Something happened at the observatory.

40:06.760 --> 40:07.440
Really?

40:07.590 --> 40:08.150
I'm telling you,

40:08.150 --> 40:09.880
the ambulance is already here.

40:11.230 --> 40:11.830
Excuse me.

40:12.030 --> 40:13.400
Where did you say something happened?

40:13.400 --> 40:14.070
The observatory.

40:14.070 --> 40:14.880
Okay. Thanks.

40:16.640 --> 40:17.960
I heard someone fell down.

40:17.960 --> 40:18.630
What happened?

40:18.630 --> 40:19.800
Exactly, covered in blood.

40:19.800 --> 40:20.510
No way.

40:20.510 --> 40:22.240
The person can be saved, right?

40:44.720 --> 40:46.320
Is this suicide?

40:46.350 --> 40:48.390
No way. It must be an accident.

40:57.300 --> 40:58.630
I'm not going to the hospital!

40:58.630 --> 40:59.400
Can you help me call her?

40:59.400 --> 41:00.590
Please?

41:01.400 --> 41:02.570
I don't want to break up!

41:02.570 --> 41:04.010
I don't want to break up!

41:04.040 --> 41:04.980
I'm begging you!

41:05.010 --> 41:06.380
I don't want to break up!

41:06.480 --> 41:07.840
Can you call her for me?

41:07.840 --> 41:08.920
I'm begging you!

41:09.030 --> 41:10.190
I'm not going to the hospital!

41:10.190 --> 41:11.280
Can you? Please?

41:11.280 --> 41:12.480
I'm begging you!

41:16.510 --> 41:21.720
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

41:22.740 --> 41:24.740
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

41:24.960 --> 41:28.700
♪ Let the night pass more slowly ♪

41:31.180 --> 41:35.620
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪
